1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,736
Hamburgers, egg pancakes, sizzling noodles

2
00:00:02,736 --> 00:00:05,539
Rice balls, toast, and savory soy milk

3
00:00:05,539 --> 00:00:09,076
There are so many delicious breakfasts
around the world

4
00:00:09,076 --> 00:00:13,347
I'm going to collect them all in my
breakfast truck

5
00:00:13,347 --> 00:00:14,214
And so,

6
00:00:14,214 --> 00:00:16,216
Beelu, who loves breakfast,

7
00:00:16,216 --> 00:00:18,619
set off on an adventure to collect

8
00:00:18,619 --> 00:00:20,954
all kinds of breakfast!

9
00:00:55,722 --> 00:00:58,191
That was fun!

10
00:01:00,394 --> 00:01:01,929
Let's find breakfast!

11
00:01:01,929 --> 00:01:04,798
Good morning, Beelu! Good morning, kids!

12
00:01:04,798 --> 00:01:07,801
Today's breakfast is an egg pancake

13
00:01:07,801 --> 00:01:09,670
In the adventure story coming up,

14
00:01:09,670 --> 00:01:12,072
there will be three egg pancake stickers

15
00:01:12,072 --> 00:01:13,674
Help Beelu

16
00:01:13,674 --> 00:01:15,809
find where they are!

17
00:01:15,809 --> 00:01:18,679
Let's collect today's breakfast!

18
00:01:27,020 --> 00:01:28,422
Wow, what a pretty lady!

19
00:01:28,422 --> 00:01:31,625
Looks like you really like our Happy Eggs

20
00:01:31,625 --> 00:01:35,362
Yeah! Your eggs are so big and white

21
00:01:35,362 --> 00:01:38,298
They're perfect for making my

22
00:01:44,371 --> 00:01:46,640
Energy Egg Pancake!

23
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:49,376
Wow, that's amazing!

24
00:01:49,376 --> 00:01:50,377
Miss!

25
00:01:50,377 --> 00:01:52,446
I'd like an Energy Egg Pancake too

26
00:01:52,512 --> 00:01:54,314
No problem, Beelu

27
00:01:54,314 --> 00:01:55,983
Have a seat over there

28
00:01:55,983 --> 00:01:57,651
Wow, kiddo

29
00:01:57,651 --> 00:01:59,453
You really know how to pick eggs

30
00:01:59,453 --> 00:02:01,254
Miss, I'll be off now

31
00:02:01,254 --> 00:02:03,657
All right, handsome. Thank you

32
00:02:03,657 --> 00:02:05,659
You're welcome

33
00:02:08,862 --> 00:02:09,930
(Is he gone?)

34
00:02:14,267 --> 00:02:17,938
(That's great!)

35
00:02:21,074 --> 00:02:22,342
(Look!)

36
00:02:22,342 --> 00:02:23,944
(What?)

37
00:02:25,145 --> 00:02:28,281
(Let's take that hat back to Mom!)

38
00:02:32,285 --> 00:02:34,755
Wow, what a pretty hat!

39
00:02:34,755 --> 00:02:36,556
Thank you for the gift, kids

40
00:02:36,556 --> 00:02:40,494
(Happy!)

41
00:02:40,494 --> 00:02:41,762
(Good idea!)

42
00:02:41,762 --> 00:02:46,500
(Let's come up with a plan!)

43
00:02:47,901 --> 00:02:51,238
Your Energy Egg Pancake is ready

44
00:02:51,238 --> 00:02:53,440
Let's eat!

45
00:02:57,978 --> 00:03:00,847
Oh, thank you

46
00:03:00,847 --> 00:03:03,850
(You're welcome!)

47
00:03:11,591 --> 00:03:11,992
(Come on!)

48
00:03:11,992 --> 00:03:13,393
(Come on!)

49
00:03:14,795 --> 00:03:17,731
Hmm?

50
00:03:17,731 --> 00:03:20,333
So spicy!

51
00:03:23,470 --> 00:03:24,938
(Here we go!)

52
00:03:25,939 --> 00:03:28,542
(That's great! Yay!)

53
00:03:28,542 --> 00:03:29,543
What are you doing?

54
00:03:29,543 --> 00:03:31,878
Give me back my hat!

55
00:03:31,878 --> 00:03:34,081
Stop!

56
00:03:34,081 --> 00:03:36,349
Don't run! I'm getting angry!

57
00:03:36,349 --> 00:03:39,219
Wow, you three are full of energy!

58
00:03:39,219 --> 00:03:42,022
How dare you ruin my egg pancake!

59
00:03:45,692 --> 00:03:47,027
I've got you now!

60
00:03:54,434 --> 00:03:55,435
(That's great!)

61
00:03:56,436 --> 00:03:58,038
Hey, you three!

62
00:03:58,038 --> 00:04:00,907
I need those eggs to make egg pancakes

63
00:04:00,907 --> 00:04:02,642
Don't waste them

64
00:04:08,048 --> 00:04:10,317
Come here!

65
00:04:10,317 --> 00:04:11,384
Give me back my hat!

66
00:04:11,384 --> 00:04:13,320
(Oh no! We're surrounded!)

67
00:04:18,325 --> 00:04:19,860
My car!

68
00:04:19,860 --> 00:04:21,928
Don't worry, Auntie!

69
00:04:24,131 --> 00:04:27,067
Take my breakfast truck!

70
00:04:27,067 --> 00:04:28,735
Let's go!

71
00:04:38,678 --> 00:04:41,014
Give me back my hat!

72
00:05:18,185 --> 00:05:20,253
This place has no energy

73
00:05:22,055 --> 00:05:23,790
I've found you!

74
00:05:26,927 --> 00:05:27,794
(Here you go)

75
00:05:27,794 --> 00:05:31,665
Wow, what a pretty hat!

76
00:05:33,466 --> 00:05:40,807
Stop slacking off! Stop slacking off!

77
00:05:40,807 --> 00:05:45,011
Miss, what are you doing here?

78
00:05:52,085 --> 00:05:54,487
Here, your hat

79
00:05:54,487 --> 00:05:56,022
Thank you

80
00:05:56,022 --> 00:05:57,557
I'm really sorry

81
00:05:57,557 --> 00:05:58,758
Those three little troublemakers

82
00:05:58,758 --> 00:06:01,695
ran off again without permission

83
00:06:02,629 --> 00:06:03,563
Excuse me,

84
00:06:03,563 --> 00:06:06,233
are the Happy Eggs I used this morning

85
00:06:06,233 --> 00:06:08,635
all from here?

86
00:06:08,635 --> 00:06:09,769
That's right, Miss

87
00:06:09,769 --> 00:06:11,905
To thank you for visiting our farm,

88
00:06:11,905 --> 00:06:14,241
take these eggs home and try them

89
00:06:14,241 --> 00:06:15,842
Come back and buy some if you like them

90
00:06:15,842 --> 00:06:18,178
But I...

91
00:06:45,538 --> 00:06:46,473
Auntie,

92
00:06:46,473 --> 00:06:47,674
Happy Eggs

93
00:06:47,674 --> 00:06:50,277
don't look happy at all

94
00:06:50,277 --> 00:06:51,344
That's right

95
00:06:51,344 --> 00:06:54,881
They all seem so low on energy

96
00:06:54,881 --> 00:06:57,751
I really want to help them

97
00:06:57,751 --> 00:07:01,821
Hmm, but what should we do?

98
00:07:03,490 --> 00:07:04,624
I've got it!

99
00:07:04,624 --> 00:07:07,160
Let's do the Breakfast Brain Workout

100
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:09,162
and think of a good idea!

101
00:07:09,162 --> 00:07:11,097
The Breakfast Brain Workout?

102
00:07:11,097 --> 00:07:12,966
How do we do it?

103
00:07:12,966 --> 00:07:16,636
Of course, we dance along with the
breakfast truck

104
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:35,522
It's Brain Workout Time!

105
00:07:35,522 --> 00:07:39,125
Circle your left hand, circle your right hand

106
00:07:39,125 --> 00:07:41,261
Clap! Clap!

107
00:07:41,261 --> 00:07:42,662
Jump up!

108
00:07:42,662 --> 00:07:42,862
Jump up!

109
00:07:42,862 --> 00:07:46,533
Move your left brain, move your right
brain

110
00:07:46,533 --> 00:07:48,268
Clap! Clap!

111
00:07:48,268 --> 00:07:49,002
Jump up!

112
00:07:49,135 --> 00:07:50,270
Jump up!

113
00:07:50,270 --> 00:07:54,007
Make a sun with your hands and say good
morning

114
00:07:54,007 --> 00:07:56,209
Clap! Clap!

115
00:07:56,209 --> 00:07:59,012
Bi Ru Akokay

116
00:08:01,147 --> 00:08:03,950
Auntie, I've got a good idea

117
00:08:03,950 --> 00:08:05,018
We'll use your trick in a moment

118
00:08:05,018 --> 00:08:07,153
Like this, like this, then like that

119
00:08:07,153 --> 00:08:09,889
Then like this, like this, like this

120
00:08:12,759 --> 00:08:16,629
Auntie, is this far enough?

121
00:08:16,629 --> 00:08:18,498
No problem

122
00:08:22,102 --> 00:08:25,171
Charge!

123
00:08:30,243 --> 00:08:32,579
Miss, don't do that!

124
00:08:32,579 --> 00:08:34,114
Your Happy Eggs

125
00:08:34,114 --> 00:08:37,384
have no energy at all!

126
00:08:37,384 --> 00:08:39,519
Don't bully the chicks!

127
00:08:40,854 --> 00:08:42,255
Go, go!

128
00:08:42,255 --> 00:08:43,656
Sorry

129
00:08:50,063 --> 00:08:51,731
Bye-bye!

130
00:08:56,936 --> 00:09:00,673
Beelu, would you like an Energy Egg Pancake?

131
00:09:00,673 --> 00:09:00,874
Yes!

132
00:09:00,874 --> 00:09:01,808
Yes!

133
00:09:01,808 --> 00:09:05,678
But I don't want eggs from this bad farm

134
00:09:05,678 --> 00:09:07,881
Okay, no problem

135
00:09:11,284 --> 00:09:13,953
The egg pancake is delicious!

136
00:09:13,953 --> 00:09:16,289
That was fun!

137
00:09:23,763 --> 00:09:25,765
Let's find breakfast!

138
00:09:25,765 --> 00:09:27,567
Here are the answers!

139
00:09:27,567 --> 00:09:30,437
Today's breakfast stickers are in these
places

140
00:09:34,107 --> 00:09:35,775
Did you find them?

141
00:09:38,578 --> 00:09:41,381
Yeah, I knew it!

142
00:09:42,582 --> 00:09:45,318
How do you make a delicious egg pancake?

143
00:09:45,318 --> 00:09:48,054
First, prepare fresh eggs

144
00:09:48,054 --> 00:09:50,390
Pour the egg mixture onto the griddle

145
00:09:51,991 --> 00:09:53,460
Lay the pancake wrapper on top

146
00:09:54,994 --> 00:09:56,262
Flip it over

147
00:09:56,262 --> 00:09:58,198
Add pepper

148
00:09:59,999 --> 00:10:01,601
Roll it up

149
00:10:02,735 --> 00:10:03,937
Cut it into pieces

150
00:10:07,140 --> 00:10:09,275
Plate it and drizzle with soy paste

151
00:10:09,275 --> 00:10:11,411
And the delicious egg pancake is ready!

152
00:10:12,412 --> 00:10:14,681
You can also

153
00:10:14,681 --> 00:10:16,416
add your favorite ingredients while making
it

154
00:10:16,416 --> 00:10:18,952
And create different flavors of egg
pancakes

155
00:10:18,952 --> 00:10:21,221
What flavor of egg pancake do you like?

156
00:10:21,221 --> 00:10:23,089
I like them all!

157
00:10:25,492 --> 00:10:30,029
Auntie, why are eggs packed in cartons
like this?

158
00:10:30,029 --> 00:10:33,566
To keep them from breaking

159
00:10:33,566 --> 00:10:34,901
In the old days, people delivering eggs

160
00:10:34,901 --> 00:10:38,571
put them all in a big basket

161
00:10:38,571 --> 00:10:41,975
On the way from the farm to the store,

162
00:10:41,975 --> 00:10:43,910
the bumpy roads

163
00:10:43,910 --> 00:10:45,311
and even the slightest bumps

164
00:10:45,311 --> 00:10:47,647
made the eggs knock against each other

165
00:10:47,647 --> 00:10:50,316
and break into pieces

166
00:10:50,316 --> 00:10:52,986
A report in the United States once showed

167
00:10:52,986 --> 00:10:55,321
that if you added up all the eggs broken

168
00:10:55,321 --> 00:10:57,924
in a month's worth of deliveries,

169
00:10:57,924 --> 00:10:59,392
their value

170
00:10:59,392 --> 00:11:03,663
could have bought more than 300 cars back
then

171
00:11:03,663 --> 00:11:06,533
Wow, that's a huge loss!

172
00:11:06,533 --> 00:11:08,067
That's right. Later,

173
00:11:08,067 --> 00:11:11,738
someone invented wooden crates with
compartments

174
00:11:11,738 --> 00:11:14,541
so every egg had its own little room

175
00:11:14,541 --> 00:11:16,676
and wouldn't bump into the others

176
00:11:16,676 --> 00:11:19,879
But eggs come in different sizes

177
00:11:19,879 --> 00:11:23,483
When there was space between an egg and
the wood,

178
00:11:23,483 --> 00:11:26,486
it could hit the wood and break

179
00:11:26,486 --> 00:11:29,489
These problems weren't solved

180
00:11:29,489 --> 00:11:32,559
until the new egg carton was invented

181
00:11:32,559 --> 00:11:34,961
Look at its lovely curved shape

182
00:11:34,961 --> 00:11:36,629
It cradles each egg

183
00:11:36,629 --> 00:11:38,498
Along with sorting the eggs by size before
shipping,

184
00:11:38,498 --> 00:11:42,302
this process

185
00:11:42,302 --> 00:11:44,103
helps every egg

186
00:11:44,103 --> 00:11:47,373
arrive safely in our hands

187
00:11:47,373 --> 00:11:50,043
Wow, I never knew

188
00:11:50,043 --> 00:11:52,111
egg cartons had such an interesting story

189
00:11:52,111 --> 00:11:53,846
That's right!
